{"id":47302,"date":"2025-12-17T06:21:12","date_gmt":"2025-12-17T05:21:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-do-porto-2\/"},"modified":"2026-08-15T18:00:13","modified_gmt":"2026-08-15T17:00:13","slug":"maratona-do-porto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-do-porto\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona do Porto 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO MARATONA DO PORTO -->\n\n<!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Maratona do Porto 2026<\/span>\n  <\/h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A Maratona do Porto regressa no dia <strong>8 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> para desafiar milhares de atletas na marginal da Invicta, ao longo de 42,195 km, 10 km e 6 km disputados inteiramente em asfalto. O tra\u00e7ado plano convida a impor um ritmo constante e fluido \u00e0 beira-mar e ao longo do Rio Douro, embora as tiradas abertas \u00e0 orla costeira exijam aten\u00e7\u00e3o especial \u00e0 for\u00e7a do vento atl\u00e2ntico.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT (EXCELENTE PARA SEO & RESPOSTAS R\u00c1PIDAS) -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">\/ Snapshot<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>8 de novembro de 2026<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Porto (Partida junto ao SEA LIFE Porto \/ Chegada no Queim\u00f3dromo)<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>Maratona (42,195 km), EDP 10K (10 km) e Mimosa APO (6 km)<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Asfalto \/ Piso Urbano Plano<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Prova &#038; Percurso<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n    A prova destaca-se por um perfil altim\u00e9trico extremamente r\u00e1pido e maioritariamente plano, acumulando <strong>menos de 40 metros de ganho de eleva\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> ao longo de todo o percurso. A totalidade da extens\u00e3o \u00e9 percorrida sobre piso asf\u00e1ltico regular de boa ader\u00eancia.\n  <\/p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Os trechos expostos ao longo da linha de costa exigem aten\u00e7\u00e3o ao vento atl\u00e2ntico, enquanto a passagem pelas pontes e zona hist\u00f3rica apresenta retas longas e alinhadas, ideais para manter um ritmo cont\u00ednuo.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 4. BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE (CTA INTERATIVO) -->\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner {\n    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important;\n    border-radius: 16px !important;\n    padding: 18px 22px !important;\n    margin: 24px 0 !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: space-between !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n    gap: 14px !important;\n    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-header {\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n    margin-bottom: 4px !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-title {\n    color: #FFFFFF !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc {\n    color: #94A3B8 !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn {\n    display: inline-flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important;\n    color: #C4B5FD !important;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    padding: 10px 20px !important;\n    border-radius: 20px !important;\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">\n    Calculadora de Pace \u2192\n  <\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 5. ONDE FICAR \/ ALOJAMENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar no Porto (Alojamento)<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Para facilitar a desloca\u00e7\u00e3o no dia da prova e no levantamento do dorsal, recomendamos duas zonas estrat\u00e9gicas:\n  <\/p>\n  <ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Zona da Matosinhos \/ Nevogilde \/ Foz (Perto da Partida):<\/strong> Ideal para quem prefere ir a p\u00e9 at\u00e9 \u00e0 partida e chegada no Queim\u00f3dromo (Parque da Cidade).\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Zona da Boavista \/ Alf\u00e2ndega:<\/strong> Excelente acesso aos transportes oficiais do evento, \u00e0 Expo Maratona (Centro de Congressos da Alf\u00e2ndega) e aos principais restaurantes da cidade.\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA E SOBRE O LOCAL -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O percurso cruza locais emblem\u00e1ticos como a Foz do Douro e oferece perspetivas \u00fanicas da Ponte Dom Lu\u00eds I. Para repor energias ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o acumulado, a recomenda\u00e7\u00e3o cl\u00e1ssica \u00e9 uma tradicional <strong>Francesinha portuense<\/strong> \u2014 coberta de queijo derretido e molho denso ligeiramente picante \u2014, acompanhada por batatas fritas crocantes.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 7. SEC\u00c7\u00c3O DE FAQS (DESIGN SYSTEM HOMEPAGE) -->\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a EDP Maratona do Porto 2026.<\/p>\n\n  <div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais s\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e no site oficial da prova logo ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o do evento.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de participante e dorsal?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>O levantamento realiza-se na EXPO Maratona, no Centro de Congressos da Alf\u00e2ndega do Porto, durante a sexta-feira e o s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 prova.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Como posso definir os meus ritmos de corrida?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Podes utilizar a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo de Corrida<\/a> ou a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/tabela-paces-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Tabela de Paces de Maratona<\/a>.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n  \n      <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar outras maratonas nacionais?<\/summary>\n        <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n          Explora a lista completa de provas de 42 km no nosso <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\">Calend\u00e1rio de Maratonas em Portugal<\/a>.\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- 8. SCHEMA DADOS ESTRUTURADOS JSON-LD -->\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Os resultados oficiais s\u00e3o disponibilizados no site oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de participante e dorsal?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"O levantamento realiza-se na EXPO Maratona, no Centro de Congressos da Alf\u00e2ndega do Porto.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Como posso definir os meus ritmos de corrida?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Podes utilizar a Calculadora de Ritmo de Corrida do Portugal Running (https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/).\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n<\/script>\n\n<!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO MARATONA DO PORTO -->\n\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":47303,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,31],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47302","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/mp26_site_maratona.jpg.950x400_q95_crop_upscale-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47302","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=47302"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\